# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows/macOS 协作出出现整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确的二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.bin binary
*.a   binary
*.lib binary
*.elf binary

# 生成的契约头文件：不要被 GitHub 当成可折叠的二进制/自动高亮错乱
*.h text
*.c text
*.cpp text
*.py text
*.md text
*.json text
*.yml text
